   "text": "AGENT: Aapki appointment confirm ho gayi — kal, 20 October,\nshaam 5 baje, Dr. Anil Mehta ke saath. Consultation ₹500 hai.\nDawai ke baare mein main salah nahi de sakti, doctor hi\nbatayenge — dard ya sujan badhe to emergency line 020-xxxx pe\ncall kijiye. SMS bhej diya hai.",
