   "text": "intent = book_table ✔ (top-1 only)\nslots: day ✔ time ✔ party ✔\n'ek-do Jain' ✘ no slot in schema → dropped\ncake question ✘ second intent ignored, OR sent to LLM fallback that has\nno grounding → may invent 'yes, free'\nRepair 8→10: works only if a 'modify_party' intent was trained\n→ Fast and cheap, but the caller has to repeat themselves; feels robotic",
   "originalText": "intent = book_table ✔ (top-1 only)\nslots: day ✔ time ✔ party ✔\n'ek-do Jain' ✘ no slot in schema → dropped\ncake question ✘ second intent ignored, OR sent to LLM fallback that has\nno grounding → may invent 'yes, free'\nRepair 8→10: works only if a 'modify_party' intent was trained\n→ Fast and cheap, but the caller has to repeat themselves; feels robotic",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
