   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Understands all 3 parts ✔, sounds natural ✔\nCake: answers correctly only if the fee is in the prompt; otherwise\nconfidently invents\nRepair 8→10: may keep earlier 'available' belief and say 'done, 9:15 for\n10' without re-checking\nMay say 'booked' without calling the tool (τ-Voice failure)\nFrontier model each turn → 1.2–2 s pauses; cost grows with call length",
   "originalText": "Understands all 3 parts ✔, sounds natural ✔\nCake: answers correctly only if the fee is in the prompt; otherwise\nconfidently invents\nRepair 8→10: may keep earlier 'available' belief and say 'done, 9:15 for\n10' without re-checking\nMay say 'booked' without calling the tool (τ-Voice failure)\nFrontier model each turn → 1.2–2 s pauses; cost grows with call length",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
