   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "All 3 parts handled ✔ (thinker = frontier-grade understanding)\nJain → fact F-7, cake fee → fact F-9 (grounded) ✔\nRepair 8→10 marks old receipt STALE → re-check forced by state, not by\nluck ✔\n'Confirmed' only after payment receipt ✔\n~0.7 s: talker is small + local; tool waits covered by honest fillers\nNLU from (A) can live INSIDE as a cheap fast-path router",
   "originalText": "All 3 parts handled ✔ (thinker = frontier-grade understanding)\nJain → fact F-7, cake fee → fact F-9 (grounded) ✔\nRepair 8→10 marks old receipt STALE → re-check forced by state, not by\nluck ✔\n'Confirmed' only after payment receipt ✔\n~0.7 s: talker is small + local; tool waits covered by honest fillers\nNLU from (A) can live INSIDE as a cheap fast-path router",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
