   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Green = strong · Yellow = acceptable · Red = weak.  ₹ / latency numbers are engineering estimates for India-hosted stacks, not vendor quotes; ASR + TTS + telephony (~₹1–2/min) are the same for all three and excluded.",
   "originalText": "Green = strong · Yellow = acceptable · Red = weak.  ₹ / latency numbers are engineering estimates for India-hosted stacks, not vendor quotes; ASR + TTS + telephony (~₹1–2/min) are the same for all three and excluded.",
